{"parentUuid":"6f60b292-4265-471d-b845-e2d7f1dda3ef","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d8a78b35-1271-4237-989d-8c9484703120","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012uS7THsyNn1wzis91Pe1SE","type":"tool_result","content":"onb.1.body | label | Gemma writes six words. Your friends get a link.\nonb.nameHint | hint | Only your crew sees it.\ntip.send | hint | It lights only when this many can come.\napp.tier.hub | hint | Made on our laptop\ncamera.denied.howto | hint | To turn it on, open Settings, then Safari, then Camera.\nsend.quorumLabel | label | How many, you included\nneed.detail | hint | {n} in, {q} to go ahead. Nobody sees who.\ncompass.stop | button | Stop talking\nladder.madeHub | hint | Made on our laptop from OpenStreetMap and today's sunset.\nmenu.forget | title | Forget this group\nforget.title | title | Forget this group?\nog.run.desc | og-desc | Flare is open source. Run the app and the Gemma 4 model on your own laptop with Ollama.\nsite.privacy.p5 | prose | No accounts, no ads, no trackers, and no fonts or scripts from other sites.\nsite.privacy.row.photo.when | prose | Within 5 minutes of the end. Names go when you tap “Forget this group”.\nsite.privacy.row.sparks.when | prose | After 180 days with no meetups, or when the last person taps “Forget this group”.\nsite.privacy.audit1 | prose | The audit runs after the field test on Sun Oct 11.\nsite.access.g1 | prose | VoiceOver and the largest text size get tested on 4 real iPhones on Sun Oct 11. Until then, those results are not in.\nsite.access.feedback | prose | Found a barrier? Tell us in the comments on our DEV post, and we'll fix it or list it here.\nsite.run.title | title | Run it yourself\nsite.run.body | prose | Flare is open source. The AI is the open-weight Gemma 4 model, run with Ollama on your own laptop, so no closed API sees your photos.\nsite.run.note | prose | The repository link goes live when the repo is public. Setup steps are in the README.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9672ac2d-e35f-4db7-95ba-24c517566b0a","timestamp":"2026-10-11T16:56:09.424Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"onb.1.body | label | Gemma writes six words. Your friends get a link.\nonb.nameHint | hint | Only your crew sees it.\ntip.send | hint | It lights only when this many can come.\napp.tier.hub | hint | Made on our laptop\ncamera.denied.howto | hint | To turn it on, open Settings, then Safari, then Camera.\nsend.quorumLabel | label | How many, you included\nneed.detail | hint | {n} in, {q} to go ahead. Nobody sees who.\ncompass.stop | button | Stop talking\nladder.madeHub | hint | Made on our laptop from OpenStreetMap and today's sunset.\nmenu.forget | title | Forget this group\nforget.title | title | Forget this group?\nog.run.desc | og-desc | Flare is open source. Run the app and the Gemma 4 model on your own laptop with Ollama.\nsite.privacy.p5 | prose | No accounts, no ads, no trackers, and no fonts or scripts from other sites.\nsite.privacy.row.photo.when | prose | Within 5 minutes of the end. Names go when you tap “Forget this group”.\nsite.privacy.row.sparks.when | prose | After 180 days with no meetups, or when the last person taps “Forget this group”.\nsite.privacy.audit1 | prose | The audit runs after the field test on Sun Oct 11.\nsite.access.g1 | prose | VoiceOver and the largest text size get tested on 4 real iPhones on Sun Oct 11. Until then, those results are not in.\nsite.access.feedback | prose | Found a barrier? Tell us in the comments on our DEV post, and we'll fix it or list it here.\nsite.run.title | title | Run it yourself\nsite.run.body | prose | Flare is open source. The AI is the open-weight Gemma 4 model, run with Ollama on your own laptop, so no closed API sees your photos.\nsite.run.note | prose | The repository link goes live when the repo is public. Setup steps are in the README.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"847b4b6e-e6df-4635-be1b-00bd727