- #15 Nav links on phones.\n- #16 \"No install needed\" on the run page, and commands scroll instead of wrapping.\n- #17 Dated placeholders now say what's true.\n- #19 The desktop app stays phone-width.\n- #20 Mute voice.\n\nStill open: #18 (the how page repeats the landing) and parts of #14 and #20. I'll fix those locally but won't deploy until round 2 reports, so the tester sees a stable site.\n\nTests: e2e demo 8/8, kit a11y 0, pwa, field 27/27, loop, telegram and sparks all pass. Copy-lint shows 0 problems.\n\nFounder flag: site.run.note still says the repo link goes live when it's public. That's true; making it public needs the founder's yes.","type":"message","recipient":"uds:<socket>","recipient_kind":"session","content":"The fresh-eyes fixes are live (86d5b65), and the …"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1465,"cache_read_input_tokens":222820,"output_tokens":1073,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":61},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1465,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1073,"cache_read_input_tokens":222820,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1465,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1465},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01KkhTPjGvD39MfNggwMZk4c":{"to":"uds:<socket>","summary":"Fresh-eyes fixes live; round 2 running","message":"The fresh-eyes fixes are live (86d5b65), and the demo e2e passes against the live URL. Round 2 is running now with a brand-new subagent that has no context.\n\nTop five, all done:\n- #1 Onboarding showing behind Send: I couldn't reproduce it on the normal path. 