{"parentUuid":"6fb45929-fdb7-4523-9d5b-1f7a6f365930","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvs2yRCxHsRkoXvWwZD1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RxMtMMKV57gS9Lb5fxmhok","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd \"<project>/flare\" && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nFresh-eyes round 2 fixes (6/10): one place field, a demo that adds up\n\n- Send: one place field. When you type where you are, that is the\n  line; the Where you'll be row shows only when the map named the spot.\n  Fields have one box, not a box in a box, on the photo.\n- Demo: keeps the place you type; opens with \"A sample invite from\n  you, {name}. Tap Send it.\"; \"Friend's view\" and \"Now you're Amor, a\n  friend of {name}.\"; a condition shows as \"You're in if: back by 5\n  PM\"; bench 40 m, 2 min walk and 150 m agree; \"here\" and the faces\n  follow the real count; the compass line starts with a capital; the\n  photo is preloaded.\n- Copy: \"Writing a short invite…\", \"Use my words\", \"Bench at the spot\".\n- Site: on phones the words and Try a demo come first, the screenshot\n  under them (grid order changes paint order, so z-index keeps the\n  words on top); a shorter link row.\n- /how/: small screens beside each line on phones, 240 px sources.\n- JS budget: onboarding and the Plan screens load on demand; /app\n  149 KB (was 151.2).\nLighthouse 100 on all five pages, mobile and desktop. e2e: demo, kit\na11y 0, loop, telegram, sparks, field 27/27, pwa; unit 668/58/26.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit push -q 2>&1 | tail -1 && npm run deploy:render -- --yes 2>&1 | grep \"deploy started\"","description":"Commit round-2 fixes, push, deploy","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":510,"cache_read_input_tokens":290464,"output_tokens":703,"output_t